note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Own Omega LLM forward GEMM policy. Compose with host.om and gemm_ir.om.
note x is the existing gemm_host_plan wire: type rt ct wm wn stall mutant band M N K layout ...
note Inference only. Caller rounds finite f32 operands RNE to BF16 before PACK, never master weights.
note mode 0 keeps exact f32 FFMA; mode 1 selects BF16 with FP32 tensor accumulate.
note Decode uses 16x8/32 threads so D384 exposes 48 column CTAs rather than 3.
note Prefill uses the existing measured 64x128/256-thread default. Shared memory is zero.
note Tensor instruction grouping and FP32 epilogue are unchanged by geometry or double buffering.
fn gemm_ollm_cfg x edit ulong 32 mode ulong to ulong
if gt mode 1
ret 1
end
put x 0 3
put x 1 1
put x 2 1
put x 3 1
put x 4 1
put x 5 4
put x 6 0
put x 7 0
if eq mode 1
put x 0 0
if ge get x 8 64
put x 1 2
put x 2 4
put x 3 2
put x 4 4
put x 7 8
end
end
if eq gemm_host_cfg x 0
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
